<title>CHILE: RESEARCH ALERT-CTC reaffirmed at sell.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CTC reaffirmed at sell.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Flemings Securities reaffirmed its sell recommendation for Compania de Telecomunicaciones de Chile.</p>
<p>London-based Flemings analysts William Laurent and Ronald Aitken said CTC's valuation is currently high and the company is vulnerable to strong competition from new local phone service operators.</p>
<p>They forecast sales of 143.4 billion pesos in the fourth quarter after 142.3 billion in the previous quarter.</p>
<p>--Santiago bureau +56-2-699-5595 x211</p>
</text>
